{"title":"Trout Pie","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Cooking Lv 35) · Monster drop: Thak Spearman, Thak Veteran, Thak Footman, Thak Reaver, War Captain Tavrek +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Cooking at level 35 <span class=\"muted\">(90 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/dough\">Dough</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/trout\">Trout</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-reaver\" title=\"Thak Reaver - dropped it in 4 of 4 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a0170e59ed8f65bfd7f3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Reaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-war-captain\" title=\"War Captain Tavrek - dropped it in 3 of 3 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4b5d189b64819d39e2b9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">War Captain Tavrek</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"thak-veteran\" title=\"Thak Veteran - dropped it in 13 of 24 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ff071ed391eae276969c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Veteran</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-shieldbearer\" title=\"Thak Shieldbearer - dropped it in 3 of 12 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e4f67001d17ee589aa8c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Shieldbearer</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\